  "ruleText": "Adm 611.14 Closing Date. If items are to be disposed of by way of an auction or other competitive bidding process, state surplus management shall establish a closing date.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Adm 611) #10364, eff 7-1-13; ss by #13708, eff 7-29-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Adm 600)",
